    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "king",
      "text": "My tower... Idris's tower. He left a flaw in it. He always did."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "And he taught me to find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "king",
      "text": "Then take the crown. Put it on. Feel every age kneel to you. No man has ever refused it."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "I am not a king."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "king",
      "text": "No... only an engineer. He said the same, the night he broke it."
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "duration": 1.2
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "He is gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "sound",
      "sound": "weakPoint"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "Six shards, whole again. It is warm now. It wants a head to wear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "camera",
      "x": 2.5,
      "y": -1.6,
      "viewHeight": 7,
      "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "Stone and steel cannot break star-iron. Only the fire it fell in."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "Set it on the rock, General. Titus, your hammer. The fire is mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "move",
      "actor": "titus",
      "x": 3.5,
      "duration": 1.8
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "titus",
      "text": "Nine years they made me break men for a crowd. Let me break this for all of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "sound",
      "sound": "ignite"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "duration": 0.8
    },
    {
      "type": "sound",
